<p>aye momino judaai hai dulha dulhan me aaj<br />
qillat kafan hai paikar-e- ibn-e- hassan me aaj<br />
hai shor alwedaa ka har ek mard-o- zan me aaj<br />
hai beqaraar rooh hassan ki kafan me aaj</p>

<p>shaadi ki jaa pa noubat-e- faryaad aah hai<br />
dulha ki taqt gaah bas ab qatl gaah hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rote the dhaade maar ke namoos-e- shaah-e- dee'n<br />
aaya dulhan se milne ko shabbar ka naaznee'n<br />
roti thi sar ko zaanu pa rakkhe wo mah jabee'n<br />
sadme se hilgaya jigar-e- qaasim-e- hazee'n</p>

<p>dil thaam kar sooe ruq-e- kubra nigaah ki<br />
ye dard utha ke baith ke masnad pa aah ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rakh kar dulhan ke maathe pa haath apna yu'n kaha<br />
sar ko uthaao roti ho kyu'n tum pa mai fida<br />
saaheb tumhaare baap ne to ham ko di riza<br />
do tum bhi izn-e jung ke narghe me hai chacha</p>

<p>aate hai teer-e- zulm shah-e- qushqisaal par<br />
wallah jaaye rehem hai ammu ke haal par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ibn-e- hassan ne batho'n me ghola bahot magar<br />
qufle dahan haya thi na boli wo nouhagar<br />
dulha ne jab ke rakh diya jhuk kar qadam pa sar<br />
pahlu me dil tadap gaya phatne laga jigar</p>

<p>ghunghat me aaftaab sa mu zard hogaya<br />
kaanpi ye sharm se ke badan sard hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aakhir bahake ashk ye boli wo rashk-e- maah<br />
lut-te hai bachpane me kahe'n kya zabaan se aah<br />
choda jab aap ne to hamara kaha'n nibaah<br />
qismat me tha ke qaide-sitam me phire'n tabaah</p>

<p>basti luta ke qabr ko aabaad kijiye<br />
jo aap ki qushi hame barbaad kijiye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saheb tumhe qafaa nahi loundi se is qadar<br />
bezaar mout bhi hai ke ab tak na li qabar<br />
kya bas hamara qair sidharo karo safar<br />
niklenge'n ham bhi ghar se koi dam me nange sar</p>

<p>chaale hamare sab se juda hai zamane me<br />
tum honge qatl gaah me ham qaidqaane me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baba qarib-e- marg chacha aazim-e- safar<br />
bhaai gala katane pa baandhe huwe kamar<br />
jaldi tumhi ke pahle hami'n ho-e qoo'n me tar<br />
dhoondu'n bataao kis ka sahara mai nouhagar</p>

<p>do kuch jawaab paau'n pa kyu sar jhukate hai<br />
ek raat ki dulhan ko kise sounp jaate hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roka hai kisne rote ho kaahe ko isqadar<br />
maalik quda hai, bewou ki lega wohi qabar<br />
hojaayegi hamari bhi har haal me basar<br />
samhjhenge umr bhar isi jangal ko apna ghar</p>

<p>bhaai ki aas hai hame ab to na baap ki<br />
kaatenge dukh randaape ka turbat pa aap ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>poochega gar koi ke hai kis shaqs ka mazaar<br />
tu koun hai jo roti hai yu'n aye jigar figaar<br />
us se bhi ye kahoongi mai baa chashm ashkbaar<br />
shahzaada ek tha ye falak qadr zeewiqaar</p>

<p>noushaah banke baaghe jahaa'n se guzar gaya<br />
sehra bhi sar se khulne na paya ke margaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sahab hame kalaam ki taaqat nahi hai ab<br />
ye to kaho ke tum se mulaqaat hogi kab<br />
dulhe ne bhar ke aankho'n me aansu kaha ye tab<br />
kousar pa roz-e-hashr miloonga mai tishna lab</p>

<p>daadi ke saath jab sooe firdous jaaogi<br />
jis jaa hussain honge wahi'n hamko paaogi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rokar pukari maa ke mai qurbaan jaau'n aao<br />
nargha hai shamiyo'n ka chacha ki madad ko aao<br />
beta bas ab dulhan ki mohabbat se haath uthaao<br />
lena hai baaghe quld to phal barchiyo'n ke khaao</p>

<p>sadqe gayi azeez na apna lahu karo<br />
jaldi gala katake mujhe surq- roo karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tapka ke ashk aankho'n se bola wo noujawaa'n<br />
lo ammajaan qaaleq-e- akbar nigaah baa'n<br />
jab ran se aaye laasha-e- majrooh-o- qoo'n chakaa'n<br />
is tehalke me rakhiyega apni bahu ka dhyaa'n</p>

<p>roye to aansu ponch ke samjhaaiyo inhe'n<br />
amma hamari laash na dikhlaaiyo inhe'n<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>